s get glitched up.\n\n<img width=\"1496\" height=\"854\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a5d2c72-9734-4146-bfc4-f79efcabeeba\" />\n\n(jokingly, the editor switches from english to minecraft enchanting table)\n \nI tried a few different flags but the only one that seems to have fixed the issue is the aforementioned `--rendering-driver opengl3`. At least the stutters are gone and I haven't been able to get the glitches to appear.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe glitches appear seemingly at random, haven't found a consistent setup.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122163/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122163/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}